category_count":3},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Southern","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","review_id":"uBIKDl5iKhjxObbrX9Kk_Q","date":"2019-04-22T18:35:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9202508926391602,"text_excerpt":"Tempt is in the Saint hotel so understand the noise expectation of people coming and going near the restaurant should be expected. I always order an old fashion whenever I eat at a new place, so I am highly critical of the bar, but I could not find anything I would change about this old fashioned. Although the menu is full of fancy appetizers, I ordered the loaded cheese fries and was they really exceeded my expectations with thick pieces of bacon and lots of cheese. The veal mushroom bolognese bucatini was the perfect potion size and was well prepared. The wait staff was very attentive and made sure all of our needs were met. The decor is most white (heaven) and contrasted the bar across..."},{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","review_id":"pRpwAVif0-G5XajgFhDo5A","date":"2018-09-03T16:50:27","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9189852476119995,"text_excerpt":"My wife was celebrating her 50th birthday over Labor Day weekend which also means Southern Decadence = all brunch places were packed. Tempt was able to take care of our party of 20 and treat us Rockstars. I want to thank the whole staff for making sure we were well taken care. After the all you can eat and all you can drink mimosas I was in need of a 5 hour nap so job well done. I would highly recommend this place to anyone and the Hotel that it's in was awesome exploring around it."},{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","review_id":"Nh026WGjvweB9S0h6wdmlQ","date":"2018-11-19T01:58:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9156028032302856,"text_excerpt":"We had such a nice meal. My salad was diverse, fresh, and delicious. Beautiful presentation. Mr, had the panini and fries. Crisp, super hot fries were seasoned to perfection. The panini was also delicious, grilled and we finished every bite. I know I'm in New Orleans with some of the world's best food but this is an excellent hotel restaurant and perfect. Really. The service was attentive and very gracious. The chef checked on our food. A lot of interest in making our meal a very good experience. They offer both the lunch and dinner menu through the evening."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","photo_id":"-Ycc32VzwyTcdh8J9UmgdQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/-Ycc32VzwyTcdh8J9UmgdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9139652252197266},{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","photo_id":"pMCV-uhlPdQHgTU3gVBrYA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/pMCV-uhlPdQHgTU3gVBrYA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9114837646484375},{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","photo_id":"298IJR6aE1tq1VhZZUU9uQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/298IJR6aE1tq1VhZZUU9uQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9022727012634277},{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlHJS_cU3HIAg","photo_id":"hTGps7zgmwf9JH3O7pgEsA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/hTGps7zgmwf9JH3O7pgEsA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8975983262062073},{"business_id":"54sTaZXoLAlH